# Cloudflare
.wrangler/

# Self-hosted sync-service local runtime data (live SQLite DB + backup
# snapshots) — never committed. The durable, versioned backup is
# data/events/events.jsonl (see infra/sync-service/scripts/pull-events.ts).
infra/sync-service/data/

# harden-prod-deployment: published learner config is runtime-generated,
# derived data (infra/sync-service/scripts/publish-config.ts), regenerated
# on its own cadence independent of the app — not a build input, so it's
# never committed. docker-compose.yml's gateway service bind-mounts this
# exact file (must exist, even empty, before the first `docker compose up`
# — see infra/README.md).
apps/assessment/public/config.json

